  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean + Planet Aware</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Liquid Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Silicones</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A mini, lightweight, buildable liquid-cream bronzer that delivers warmth or definition with a dewy, soft-focus finish.<br><br><b>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Plant-Derived Glycerin: A powerful humectant known to increase skin’s natural moisture level.<br>- Licorice Root Extract: Brightens the overall appearance of skin.<br>- Silica: Provides a smooth, soft feel and an even application while helping to blur.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> The Dew Bronze sheer formula is buildable, blendable, and blurring for a seamless flush of bronzed color that’s never streaky, cakey, or orange. Its chunky doe-foot is designed for the most fool-proof targeted application for both an all-over bronze or a softly sculpted look.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Using the chunky doe-foot applicator, dot or swipe to the high points of the face where the sun naturally hits (cheeks, temples, and forehead).<br>-Press into skin using The Base Brush (sold separately) for the most seamless, natural warmth. <br>-Then, sweep at the edges to blend Dew Bronze seamlessly into the skin. <br>-Saie tip: Dew Bronze sets on the skin, so blend immediately after application for the smoothest finish.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Plant-Derived Glycerin: A powerful humectant known to increase skin&rsquo;s natural moisture level.<br>-Licorice Root Extract: Brightens the overall appearance of skin.<br>-Silica: Provides a smooth, soft feel and an even application while helping to blur.<br><br>Isocetyl Stearoyl Stearate, Glycerin, Tribehenin, Glyceryl Stearate, Aqua/Water/Eau, Silica, Sambucus Nigra Fruit Extract, Mica, Glycyrrhiza Glabra (Licorice) Root Extract, Morus Alba Leaf Extract, Symphytum Officinale Leaf Extract, Oenothera Biennis (Evening Primrose) Root Extract, Tin Oxide. [+/- May Contain/Peut Contenir: Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491, Ci 77492, Ci 77499), Yellow 5 Lake (Ci 19140), Red 6 Lake (Ci 15850), Red 7 Lake (Ci 15850), Red 27 Lake (Ci 45410), Ferric Ferrocyanide (Ci 77510)].</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean + Planet Aware</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Liquid Formula</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Silicones</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A mini, lightweight, buildable liquid-cream bronzer that delivers warmth or definition with a dewy, soft-focus finish.<br><br><b>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></b>- Plant-Derived Glycerin: A powerful humectant known to increase skin’s natural moisture level.<br>- Licorice Root Extract: Brightens the overall appearance of skin.<br>- Silica: Provides a smooth, soft feel and an even application while helping to blur.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> The Dew Bronze sheer formula is buildable, blendable, and blurring for a seamless flush of bronzed color that’s never streaky, cakey, or orange. Its chunky doe-foot is designed for the most fool-proof targeted application for both an all-over bronze or a softly sculpted look.</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Using the chunky doe-foot applicator, dot or swipe to the high points of the face where the sun naturally hits (cheeks, temples, and forehead).<br>-Press into skin using The Base Brush (sold separately) for the most seamless, natural warmth. <br>-Then, sweep at the edges to blend Dew Bronze seamlessly into the skin. <br>-Saie tip: Dew Bronze sets on the skin, so blend immediately after application for the smoothest finish.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">-Plant-Derived Glycerin: A powerful humectant known to increase skin&rsquo;s natural moisture level.<br>-Licorice Root Extract: Brightens the overall appearance of skin.<br>-Silica: Provides a smooth, soft feel and an even application while helping to blur.<br><br>Isocetyl Stearoyl Stearate, Glycerin, Tribehenin, Glyceryl Stearate, Aqua/Water/Eau, Silica, Sambucus Nigra Fruit Extract, Mica, Glycyrrhiza Glabra (Licorice) Root Extract, Morus Alba Leaf Extract, Symphytum Officinale Leaf Extract, Oenothera Biennis (Evening Primrose) Root Extract, Tin Oxide. [+/- May Contain/Peut Contenir: Titanium Dioxide (Ci 77891), Iron Oxides (Ci 77491, Ci 77492, Ci 77499), Yellow 5 Lake (Ci 19140), Red 6 Lake (Ci 15850), Red 7 Lake (Ci 15850), Red 27 Lake (Ci 45410), Ferric Ferrocyanide (Ci 77510)].</div></details>",
